      {'arxiv_id': '2410.12156v2', 'title': 'FragNet: A Graph Neural Network for Molecular Property Prediction with Four Levels of Interpretability',        
      'authors': ['Gihan Panapitiya', 'Peiyuan Gao', 'C Mark Maupin', 'Emily G Saldanha'], 'summary': "Molecular property prediction is essential in a       
