DEBUG {'status': 'success', 'count': 3, 'memories': [{'id': 'mem_073', 'type': 'knowledge', 'abstract': 'FragNet introduces a GNN architecture for molecular 
      property prediction that provides four-level interpretability (atoms, bonds, fragments, fragment connections) through hierarchical message passing and 
      graph attention mechanisms, achieving SOTA on ESOL (RMSE 0.881), Clintox (AUC 86.8), and Sider (AUC 63.7) while enabling identification of             
