      **Summary of the paper:**                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                             
      The LSR-MP (Long-Short-Range Message-Passing) framework addresses a fundamental limitation in equivariant graph neural networks: their inability to    
      capture long-range interactions (electrostatic, van der Waals) critical for large molecular systems.                                                   
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Key contributions:**                                                                                                                                 
      1. **Physics-informed architecture**: Combines short-range EGNN message passing with long-range bipartite atom-fragment interactions via BRICS         
      fragmentation                                                                                                                                          
