      or octopoles，up to the set maximum degree $l _ { \mathrm { m a x } }$ .For example，molecular dipoles can be learned by combining invariant partial   
      charge predictions with atomic dipoles extracted from the EVs of degree $l = 1 ^ { 2 4 , 3 7 }$                                                        
                                                                                                                                                             
