      Long-Short-Range Message-Passing, RANGE, and Erwin use coarse-grained representations but are not directly generalizable to bulk systems; (4)          
      Physics-driven approaches subtracting long-range contributions from training data fail to account for charge-environment correlations; (5) Direct      
      charge prediction methods require correction schemes for charge conservation; (6) CENT method and 4GHDNN use Behler-type neural networks with          
