      'https://arxiv.org/pdf/2212.06370v4', 'categories': ['cs.LG', 'stat.ML']}, {'arxiv_id': '2209.14719v3', 'title': 'In Search of Projectively Equivariant
      Networks', 'authors': ['Georg Bökman', 'Axel Flinth', 'Fredrik Kahl'], 'summary': 'Equivariance of linear neural network layers is well studied. In    
      this work, we relax the equivariance condition to only be true in a projective sense. We propose a way to construct a projectively equivariant neural  
