      relevant applications, and also provides a large bibliography.', 'published': '2016-09-15', 'pdf_url': 'https://arxiv.org/pdf/1609.04846v1',           
      'categories': ['cs.NE']}, {'arxiv_id': '2112.00652v2', 'title': 'Equivariant graph neural networks for fast electron density estimation of molecules,  
