      'https://arxiv.org/pdf/1909.10086v3', 'categories': ['cs.LG', 'stat.ML']}, {'arxiv_id': '0510346v1', 'title': 'The Dark Energy Survey', 'authors':     
      ['The Dark Energy Survey Collaboration'], 'summary': 'We describe the Dark Energy Survey (DES), a proposed optical-near infrared survey of 5000 sq. deg
      of the South Galactic Cap to ~24th magnitude in SDSS griz, that would use a new 3 sq. deg CCD camera to be mounted on the Blanco 4-m telescope at Cerro
      Telolo Inter-American Observatory (CTIO). The survey data will allow us to measure the dark energy and dark matter densities and the dark energy       
