      maximal independent sets that avoid these pitfalls. Our experimental results confirm the relevance of maximal independent set constraints for graph    
      pooling.', 'published': '2023-07-24', 'pdf_url': 'https://arxiv.org/pdf/2307.13011v1', 'categories': ['cs.LG', 'cs.AI', 'cs.CV']}, {'arxiv_id':        
