      neural network interatomic potential inspired by iterative electronic relaxations', 'authors': ['So Takamoto', 'Satoshi Izumi', 'Ju Li'], 'summary': 'A
      universal interatomic potential for an arbitrary set of chemical elements is urgently needed in computational materials science. Graph convolution     
