      In this work,we develop Equivariant N-body Interaction Networks (ENINet),in which many-body level interatomic equivariant representations are          
      constructed,while the translation invariance,rotation,and reflection equivariance $\left( O ( 3 ) \right)$ of outputs with respect to atomic           
