      ^ { \ast }$ level. The data set includes over $5 7 \mathrm { k }$ structurally diverse small organic molecules composed of H, C, N,and O atoms. This   
      task is challenging due to the vast chemical space it covers,making it difficult to learn a generalizable model for the entire data set.Additionally,  
      the data set only provides energies,and the energy surfaces for molecules have many local minima and can include highenergy barriers that models must  
