      heavy atoms, i.e.,a maximum number of 8 C,N, O,F atoms. Then,we test the prediction accuracy on an internal test set,i.e., containing molecules with up
      to 8 heavy atoms,and also on a data set with the remaining QM9 molecules that have exactly 9 heavy atoms. The latter test set therefore tests the      
      extrapolation ca-pability of the derived GNNs. The results of the extrapolation are summarized in Table 2.                                             
                                                                                                                                                             
