      text for details). In $\mathbf { a }$ , circles $( \bigcirc )$ and triangles $( \triangle )$ indicate polymers seen and unseen during Vivace's         
      training,respectively. The polymers PS (seen) and PCTFE (unseen) are annotated. In panels $\mathbf { b }$ ， $\mathbf { c }$ ， $\mathbf { d }$ and    
