      ```python                                                                                                                                              
      # Sum: h = sum(node_features)  # extensive                                                                                                             
      # Mean: h = mean(node_features)  # intensive                                                                                                           
      # Max: h = max(node_features)  # intensive                                                                                                             
      # Attention: h = sum(softmax(MLP(x_i)) * x_i)  # learned intensive                                                                                     
      ```                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                             
