        │   ├── Monomer conformer generation (RDKit, 1 conformer per monomer)                                                                                
        │   ├── 3 repeat units (RUs) construction from p-SMILES                                                                                              
        │   └── Node/edge features + 3D geometric features                                                                                                   
        │                                                                                                                                                    
        ├── Geometric Feature Extraction                                                                                                                     
        │   ├── Bond lengths (from conformer coordinates)                                                                                                    
        │   ├── Bond angles (triplet angles)                                                                                                                 
        │   ├── Dihedral angles (quadruplet torsions)                                                                                                        
        │   └── Line graph for angular relationships (ENINet-style)                                                                                          
        │                                                                                                                                                    
        ├── Equivariant Layer (L1 features)                                                                                                                  
        │   ├── Vector features for directional properties                                                                                                   
        │   ├── Dipole-like representations                                                                                                                  
        │   └── Parameter-efficient angular encoding                                                                                                         
        │                                                                                                                                                    
        ├── Message Passing (GINE backbone)                                                                                                                  
        │   ├── Periodic edges for polymer periodicity                                                                                                       
        │   ├── 5 layers with residual connections                                                                                                           
        │   └── Hidden dimension: 256                                                                                                                        
        │                                                                                                                                                    
        ├── Aggregation Strategy (CRITICAL - Day 4 insight)                                                                                                  
        │   ├── Primary: MEAN pooling (intensive property)                                                                                                   
        │   ├── Compare: MAX pooling, ATTENTION pooling                                                                                                      
        │   └── Ablation: SUM pooling baseline                                                                                                               
        │                                                                                                                                                    
        └── Prediction Head                                                                                                                                  
            ├── 2-layer MLP with dropout (0.2)                                                                                                               
            └── Single output (Tg prediction)                                                                                                                
      )                                                                                                                                                      
      ```                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Key Architectural Decisions**:                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                             
      1. **Pooling Function** (Day 4 insight):                                                                                                               
         - Tg is INTENSIVE (temperature, size-independent)                                                                                                   
         - Mean pooling: natural for intensive properties                                                                                                    
         - Max pooling: captures dominant features                                                                                                           
         - Compare against sum pooling (extensive property assumption)                                                                                       
         - Also test attention-based pooling (MBNN-att style)                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                             
      2. **Equivariant Features** (Day 4 insight):                                                                                                           
         - Add L1 vector features (dipole-like)                                                                                                              
         - Captures angular/directional information                                                                                                          
         - More efficient than deeper networks                                                                                                               
         - Use simple equivariant layer: x' = x + MLP(concat[x, v·v, ||v||]))                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                             
      3. **Many-Body Interactions** (Day 4 insight):                                                                                                         
         - Construct line graph from original graph                                                                                                          
         - Line graph nodes = original graph edges                                                                                                           
         - Line graph edges = triplets (angular relationships)                                                                                               
         - Captures chain stiffness through bond angles                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                             
      4. **From Day 1-3**:                                                                                                                                   
         - Monomer conformer features (avoid 79% trimer failure rate)                                                                                        
         - Max-aggregation over 3 RUs (GRIN repetition-invariance)                                                                                           
         - Periodic edges (PerioGT polymer periodicity)                                                                                                      
         - Attention-based pooling option (MBNN-att intensive property)                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Dataset**: Tg dataset                                                                                                                                
      - Location: src/alldataset/Tg.csv (p-SMILES and Tg values)                                                                                             
      - 7170 samples, 72/8/20 train/val/test split                                                                                                           
      - Baseline: GAT RMSE=50.5, SOTA: PerioGT RMSE=30.8                                                                                                     
      - Current best: Day 1 v3 RMSE=34.14                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Experimental Strategy**:                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                             
      1. **Data Preparation**:                                                                                                                               
         - Load Tg.csv with p-SMILES and Tg values                                                                                                           
         - Construct 3 repeat units from p-SMILES                                                                                                            
         - Generate monomer conformers with RDKit (MMFF optimization)                                                                                        
         - Extract geometric features: bond lengths, angles, dihedrals                                                                                       
         - Build line graph for angular relationships                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                             
      2. **Model Variants** (ablation study):                                                                                                                
         - **IAPT_v2_mean**: Mean pooling (primary hypothesis)                                                                                               
         - **IAPT_v2_max**: Max pooling                                                                                                                      
         - **IAPT_v2_att**: Attention-based pooling                                                                                                          
         - **IAPT_v2_sum**: Sum pooling (baseline, extensive assumption)                                                                                     
         - **IAPT_v2_no_eq**: Without equivariant features (ablation)                                                                                        
         - **IAPT_v2_no_lg**: Without line graph (ablation)                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                             
      3. **Training Protocol**:                                                                                                                              
         - Optimizer: AdamW (lr=1e-3, weight_decay=1e-5)                                                                                                     
         - Scheduler: ReduceLROnPlateau (patience=10, factor=0.5)                                                                                            
         - Early stopping: patience=30 epochs                                                                                                                
         - Batch size: 32                                                                                                                                    
         - Max epochs: 500                                                                                                                                   
         - Loss: MSE loss                                                                                                                                    
         - Select best model by validation RMSE                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                             
      4. **Evaluation**:                                                                                                                                     
         - Test RMSE on held-out test set (20%)                                                                                                              
         - Compare against SOTA (30.8) and Day 1 best (34.14)                                                                                                
         - Analyze systematic bias (over/under prediction)                                                                                                   
         - Feature importance analysis                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                             
      5. **Diagnostic Analysis**:                                                                                                                            
         - Compare pooling strategies (mean vs max vs attention vs sum)                                                                                      
         - Ablation on equivariant features                                                                                                                  
         - Ablation on line graph (many-body)                                                                                                                
         - Prediction error distribution by Tg range                                                                                                         
         - Visualize learned attention weights (if using attention pooling)                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Expected Outputs**:                                                                                                                                  
      1. Trained models for each variant in src/iapt_v2_intensive_aware/models/                                                                              
      2. Results file: results.csv with train/val/test RMSE for each variant                                                                                 
      3. Diagnostic plots:                                                                                                                                   
         - Prediction vs ground truth scatter                                                                                                                
         - Error distribution by Tg range                                                                                                                    
         - Pooling strategy comparison                                                                                                                       
         - Ablation study results                                                                                                                            
      4. Analysis report: which components contribute most to improvement                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Success Criteria**:                                                                                                                                  
      - Primary: Test RMSE < 30.8 (beat SOTA)                                                                                                                
      - Secondary: Understand which Day 4 insights contribute most                                                                                           
      - Tertiary: Identify remaining gaps if SOTA not beaten                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Constraints**:                                                                                                                                       
      - Use only PyTorch, PyTorch Geometric, RDKit                                                                                                           
      - Use only Tg dataset (no other datasets)                                                                                                              
      - Working directory: src/iapt_v2_intensive_aware/                                                                                                      
      - Hardware: 2x 2080Ti (be mindful of memory)                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Honesty Principle**:                                                                                                                                 
      - Report all results honestly, even if negative                                                                                                        
      - If SOTA not beaten, analyze why                                                                                                                      
      - Identify which insights helped/hurt                                                                                                                  
      - Negative results with clear analysis are valuable'                                                                                                   
