      ### Execution Status: **COMPLETED** (Failed to beat SOTA)                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                             
      ---                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                             
      ### Results                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                             
      | Metric | Target | Achieved | Gap |                                                                                                                   
