      {'arxiv_id': '2103.08157v1', 'title': 'Pretraining Neural Architecture Search Controllers with Locality-based Self-Supervised Learning', 'authors':    
      ['Kwanghee Choi', 'Minyoung Choe', 'Hyelee Lee'], 'summary': 'Neural architecture search (NAS) has fostered various fields of machine learning. Despite
