      'categories': ['cs.CV']}, {'arxiv_id': '0609027v1', 'title': 'A U-band survey of brown dwarfs in the Taurus Molecular Cloud with the XMM-Newton        
      Optical/UV Monitor', 'authors': ['Nicolas Grosso', 'Marc Audard', 'Jérôme Bouvier', 'Kevin R. Briggs', 'Manuel Güdel', 'the The XMM-Newton Extended    
      Surveyof the Taurus Molecular Cloud', 'Collaboration'], 'summary': 'We aim to characterize the U-band variability of young brown dwarfs in the Taurus  
