      Supplementary Table 8.                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                             
      # Data availability                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                             
      The data used for pretraining and downstream tasks are available in thefigshare database: https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.25314649 (ref.48).       
                                                                                                                                                             
      # Code availability                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                             
