DEBUG {'status': 'success', 'count': 2, 'memories': [{'id': 'mem_094', 'type': 'knowledge', 'abstract': 'GraphMAE introduces a masked graph autoencoder for  
      self-supervised graph representation learning, addressing four key deficiencies in prior GAEs: over-emphasis on structure reconstruction, lack of input
      corruption, MSE sensitivity, and weak decoders. By combining masked feature reconstruction, scaled cosine error, re-mask decoding with GNN decoders,   
