      - v2: /home/home_public/aisci/AIscientist/src/5_day5_pretraining_v2/                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                             
      **Conclusion**: Pre-training on PI1M with GraphMAE + MoCL did NOT improve Tg prediction. The hypothesis that pre-training is the "critical missing     
      piece" was NOT validated. Future work should focus on polymer-specific architectures (periodicity-aware) rather than generic pre-training approaches.' 
