      ### Key Findings (Negative Result)                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                             
      1. **Pre-training did NOT help**: Despite using GraphMAE + MoCL on 100K-300K PI1M samples, fine-tuning performance did not improve. RMSE stuck at      
