      'title': 'Bi-Mamba+: Bidirectional Mamba for Time Series Forecasting', 'authors': ['Aobo Liang', 'Xingguo Jiang', 'Yan Sun', 'Xiaohou Shi', 'Ke Li'],  
      'summary': "Long-term time series forecasting (LTSF) provides longer insights into future trends and patterns. Over the past few years, deep learning  
