      Neural Networks: A Comprehensive survey', 'authors': ['Singh Akansha'], 'summary': 'Graph Neural Networks (GNNs) revolutionize machine learning for    
      graph-structured data, effectively capturing complex relationships. They disseminate information through interconnected nodes, but long-range          
      interactions face challenges known as "over-squashing". This survey delves into the challenge of over-squashing in Graph Neural Networks (GNNs), where 
