      # X2-GNN: A Physical Message Passing Neural Network with Natural Generalization Ability to Large and Complex Molecules                                 
                                                                                                                                                             
      Zhanfeng Wang, Wenhao Zhang, Minghong Jiang, Yicheng Chen, Zhenyu Zhu, Wenjie Yan, Jianming Wu,\* and Xin $\mathrm { { X u ^ { * } } }$                
                                                                                                                                                             
      Cite This: J. Phys. Chem. Lett.2024,15,12501-12512                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                             
      # Read Online                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                             
      # ACCESS I                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                             
