      feature should be less significant.For the sake of convenience, only the S model was used for PES modeling tasks in this research.For each             
      molecule,10oO conformers were used for                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                             
      training,loooo for validation,and the remainder for testing.                                                                                           
      The training settings are provided in Table S5 in section S9.                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                             
