      polymers)\n6. Fine-tune with 72/8/20 split\n7. Compare against from-scratch baseline and SOTA (30.8)\n\n**Diagnostic Analysis**:\n1. Pre-trained vs    
      from-scratch comparison\n2. Ablation on augmentation strategies\n3. t-SNE visualization of learned representations\n4. Performance analysis across Tg  
      ranges (low/mid/high)\n\n**Expected Output**:\n- Pre-trained model weights\n- Fine-tuned Tg prediction model\n- Test RMSE comparison (target: beat     
      30.8)\n- Diagnostic plots and analysis", 'connections': {}}]}                                                                                          
