      (vanishing gradients, over-smoothing, over-squashing) through a control theory lens, demonstrating that traditional GNNs suffer from "extreme gradient 
      vanishing" due to normalized adjacency contraction, and proposes GNN-SSM—a state-space model formulation that enables direct Jacobian spectrum control 
