         - Covalent edges: chemical bonds with features (bond type, conjugated, in ring)                                                                     
         - Non-covalent edges: atom pairs within 5Å cutoff (excluding covalent bonds)                                                                        
           - Edge features: distance encoding (Gaussian basis), inter-chain flag                                                                             
      4. If conformer generation fails, use 2D distance estimation (shortest path)                                                                           
