      '2025-01-30', 'pdf_url': 'https://arxiv.org/pdf/2502.01654v1', 'categories': ['cs.LG', 'cs.NE', 'physics.ao-ph']}, {'arxiv_id': '1811.05660v1',        
      'title': 'MT-CGCNN: Integrating Crystal Graph Convolutional Neural Network with Multitask Learning for Material Property Prediction', 'authors':       
      ['Soumya Sanyal', 'Janakiraman Balachandran', 'Naganand Yadati', 'Abhishek Kumar', 'Padmini Rajagopalan', 'Suchismita Sanyal', 'Partha Talukdar'],     
      'summary': "Developing accurate, transferable and computationally inexpensive machine learning models can rapidly accelerate the discovery and         
      development of new materials. Some of the major challenges involved in developing such models are, (i) limited availability of materials data as       
