      $\\partial_tu=\\frac{1}{2}\\partial_x^2u+u\\, η$ on the interval $[0, L]$ with Neumann, Dirichlet or periodic boundary conditions, driven by space-time
      white noise $η$. Using Malliavin-Stein method, we establish the central limit theorem for the fluctuation of the spatial integral $\\int_0^Lu(t\\,,    
