      learning. By learning task-independent graph embeddings across diverse datasets, DUGNN also reaps the benefits of transfer learning. Through extensive 
      experiments and ablation studies, we show that the proposed DUGNN model consistently outperforms both the existing state-of-art GNN models and Graph   
      Kernels by an increased accuracy of 3% - 8% on graph classification benchmark datasets.', 'published': '2019-09-22', 'pdf_url':                        
