      exploration of the features combination analogous to hand-crafting the most relevant features for the recognition task. MCLNN has achieved competitive 
      recognition accuracies on the GTZAN and the ISMIR2004 music datasets that surpass several state-of-the-art neural network based architectures and      
      hand-crafted methods applied on both datasets.', 'published': '2018-03-06', 'pdf_url': 'https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.02421v2', 'categories': ['stat.ML', 
