      to computational intelligence techniques to build and extract a prediction knowledge-based system. As shown by experimentation, LSTM RNNs initialized  
      with transfer learning methods have higher prediction accuracy; it incurred shorter training time than randomly initialized recurrent neural           
      networks.', 'published': '2025-01-30', 'pdf_url': 'https://arxiv.org/pdf/2502.01654v1', 'categories': ['cs.LG', 'cs.NE', 'physics.ao-ph']},            
