      are left untrained under the stability condition introduced in this work. This can be viewed as a way to study the intrinsic power of the architecture 
      of a deep GNN, and also to provide insights for the set-up of more complex fully-trained models. Through experimental results, we show that even       
      without training of the recurrent connections, the architecture of small deep GNN is surprisingly able to achieve or improve the state-of-the-art      
