      Medhat', 'David Chesmore', 'John Robinson'], 'summary': 'We present the ConditionaL Neural Network (CLNN) and the Masked ConditionaL Neural Network    
      (MCLNN) designed for temporal signal recognition. The CLNN takes into consideration the temporal nature of the sound signal and the MCLNN extends upon 
