          Arguments: 'memory_type: knowledge, abstract: DenseGNN proposes a universal and scalable GNN architecture combining Dense Connectivity Networks    
      (DCN), hierarchical node-edge graph residual networks (HRN), and Local Structure Order Parameters Embedding (LOPE) to overcome over-smoothing, enable  
