      'mem_087', 'type': 'knowledge', 'abstract': 'ENINet addresses the vanishing directional information problem in equivariant GNNs by incorporating l=1   
      equivariant many-body interactions via line graph structures, demonstrating improved accuracy on quantum chemical property prediction including both   
      scalar and tensorial properties.'}, {'id': 'mem_088', 'type': 'knowledge', 'abstract': 'This paper demonstrates that selecting GNN pooling functions   
